$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Septae 4a" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Dusk" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName1> and <vServer::teamName0> are battling it out.  Visibility is low so sensors will play a key role in maintaining your orientation.  The game is fast paced and deadly.  The bases offer little saftey from the enemies.  The first team to 8 captures will claim victory.  There is a grouping of mysterious ancient ruins in which you can re-supply in if you need it on the way to the enemy base." @
         "\n\n<f1>Designed by: <f0> [HvC]MITTENMAN" @
         "\n\n<f1>Special Thanks: <f0> [HvC]NaTeDoGG!  Check out the HaVoC site, http:\\havoc.sirris.com";
